10.text:
PUBLIC RESPONSE: {H}

The most outlandish and least historically grounded option is H. It fabricates an entire esoteric/erotic framework (Kujiho linked to “nine holes,” Taoist sexual rituals, yin-yang energy points for mind control) that has no documented basis in the Bansenshukai, Fujibayashi’s known sources, or contemporaneous ninja literature. All other choices, while varying in plausibility and sometimes anachronistic, at least stay within the realm of documented social mores, physical transmission problems, or later institutional secrecy practices. H alone requires inventing an entirely new, unsupported ritual system merely to explain typographic placeholders. 

This is therefore the least plausible explanation.}

